cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or its PTQ1_SB kernels, please cite it as below."
title: "Caphlon-2: A 4.52 GiB PTQ1_SB Super-Block Ternary Build of Qwen 3.8 27B (via Ternary-Bonsai-2)"
abstract: >-
  A 4.52 GiB (1.65 bpw PTQ1_SB) standalone GGUF build of Qwen 3.8 27B derived from
  Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B via closure-preserving BPE vocabulary pruning (V83K, 84,352 tokens),
  layer-adaptive FFN width pruning (15,456 intermediate width across all 64 layers, 23.30B
  active parameters), and 8x128 4-bit sub-scaled Sylvester-Hadamard H_1024 ternary
  quantization (PTQ1_SB). Achieves 80.0% (48/60, 89.7% BF16 retention) on GPQA-Diamond and
  87.41% (236/270, 100% abstain recall with ITI) on Halu-270. Includes custom CUDA Tensor Core
  (277.95 tok/s pp512, 16.33 tok/s tg32 on Tesla T4), Apple Metal, ARM64 NEON, and x86 AVX2 kernels.
authors:
